{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026swORbEm8Ws1792970246.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國富商馬斯克旗下的SpaceX已成功完成400億美元融資，用作購買輝達Nvidia的人工智能(AI)晶片。</p><p></p><p>馬斯克透過網上社交媒體公布，公司融資成功全賴公司取得投資信用評級，以及來自「星鏈」衛星網絡業務與火箭發射業務的收入。他表示，SpaceX與所謂的「新雲端企業」不同，那些公司主要出售高端算力予科技公司，近兩個星期因為債務沉重，以及前景不明，正受到密切關注。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》早前報道，SpaceX正透過一家特殊項目公司籌集資金，買入輝達晶片，以推動AI人工智能業務。融資由投資銀行高盛牽頭。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:39.619055+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":245,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:10.776411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.564078+00:00","content_hash":"094ff35e273faabbc4172019903ec24553d7ac3af797d48f38cc9ffe1adaaf41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:39.619055+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}